 .bars { width: 58vw; }
 .flask-row { margin-top: 6px; }
 .control-hints { display:none; }
}
```
But `.hud-bottom` uses flex justify-between; with only player-panel and control-hints hidden, fine. It will be at top left. Need `.hud-top` boss plate still. Bars at y=78. The boss plate y14-69. Good. The parry prompt at 54% = 455px. fine. The run readout top-right shows parry count only; timer hidden at max560. Good.

But on mobile, `bars` width 58vw=226, x14-240, not overlap controls at bottom. Fine.

Could also reposition boss plate lower? no.

Touch controls: layout at bottom right uses 6 buttons; visually okay, but labels tiny. Could simplify: make PARRY prominent, others smaller. Fine.

The bottom center health text "100" currently appears at bottom because bars behind. After moving, fixed.

Also joystick knob appears huge? 44px, okay.

Mobile screenshot shows boss chest glow huge, dominating. Need fix.

Let's identify glow. Use browser with aura hidden and screenshot.

